      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "Goat is mapped as 'Muslim' in the context of 'bootleg copy of muslim porn'",
      "description": "The visual entity 'goat' is mapped onto the textual concept 'Muslim' through the phrase 'just got a bootleg copy of muslim porn'. The meme uses the goat as a visual stand-in for Muslims, creating a derogatory association. This is an analogical mapping where the goat (visual) represents the group being mocked (Muslims, textual).",
